 - **Behaviour:** `bOverrideControlsBehavior` (inline toggle) + `ControlsBehavior`, else **Default Controls Behavior** in the settings. `FMediaBoxControlsBehavior` (`MediaBoxTypes.h`): `Preset` (`EMediaBoxControlsPreset`: YouTube / Custom; YouTube uses `YouTube()` whatever the fields hold, the fields greyed), Auto Hide, Hide After Idle (3 s), Hide After Unhovered (0.1 s), Show While Paused, Show While Stopped (also loading / ended), Show While Over Controls, Show While Focused, Show On Play / Pause, Fade In (0.1 s), Fade Out (0.25 s), Hide Pointer With Controls, Click To Play / Pause, Lift Subtitles. The defaults are the YouTube values.
